      "created_at": "2013-09-14T17:58:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Had both of these cards in play today.</p><p>If the lowest HP character is to take damage, would you redirect it (and apply the -1) and then send it to the Scholar (regardless if he's the highest HP or not)? Or, would the Alchemical Redirection redirect all the damage immediately to the Scholar, before it had a chance to hit the lowest HP character, therefore negating Smoke Bombs?</p><p><br>Smoke Bombs general question: If a villian hits everyone for damage, can you still redirect the damage the lowest HP character would take?<br><br>&nbsp;</p>",
